 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Not really, as long as you' not selling it. Tracing a photo gives the artist a bit more freedom to take it in new directions, so it can be a fun experiment. They probably won't even notice. The real question is whether you'd rather paint it yourself, or keep it in your photo collection? Tracing can help you see the composition more clearly. It' a good warm up. Keep the painting simple, too. More detail usually doesn't make it better, especially on a big canvas.",
